  <div class="carousel-item  col-md-4">
    <img src="https://www.iowacentral.edu/news/images/2026/Triton Hall of Fame.jpg" class="img-fluid mx-auto d-block" alt="Celebrating 2026 Hall of Fame Class This Saturday">
    <div class="newsHeadline">
